        ("How to Make a Cake","怎么做蛋糕","Making a cake is fun. Here is how. First, get the ingredients: flour, sugar, eggs, milk and butter. Second, mix them in a bowl. Third, add some chocolate. Fourth, put the mix in a pan. Fifth, put the pan in the oven. Bake for thirty minutes. Sixth, take it out and let it cool. Seventh, decorate it. Now you can eat it. Enjoy!"),
        ("My Pet Cat","我的宠物猫","I have a pet cat. Her name is Mimi. She is white and black. She has big green eyes. She is very cute. She likes to play with a ball. She likes to eat fish. She sleeps a lot during the day. At night, she is active. She can catch mice. I love Mimi. She is my good friend. I take care of her every day."),
