        ("My Hobby","我的爱好","My hobby is collecting stamps. I started when I was eight. I have more than two hundred stamps. Some are from China. Some are from other countries. My favorite is a stamp from England. It has a picture of the Queen. Stamps are small but they tell big stories. They show history, culture and nature. I learn a lot from them. Collecting stamps is fun."),
        ("A Letter to My Aunt","给阿姨的信","Dear Aunt Mary, How are you? I hope you are well. I am fine. School is busy. I have many classes. My favorite subject is English. I am learning new words every day. I made a new friend. Her name is Lily. We play together after school. Please come and visit us soon. I miss you. Love, Xiao Ming"),
